1
00:00:22,080 --> 00:00:24,920
The ultimate harem

2
00:00:27,360 --> 00:00:30,960
Leaping lightly over these hectic times

3
00:00:33,160 --> 00:00:37,440
Diving into the city,
playing at being a hero

4
00:00:37,440 --> 00:00:39,360
I wanna die with you forever

5
00:00:39,360 --> 00:00:42,160
Only the quick ones

6
00:00:42,160 --> 00:00:45,080
So you can pick it up as you go

7
00:00:45,080 --> 00:00:49,220
Because your natural face looks best of all

8
00:00:49,220 --> 00:00:50,780
Let it free

9
00:00:51,300 --> 00:00:55,000
Everybody can do, we set off running

10
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:58,240
Dreams never stop, you know

11
00:00:58,240 --> 00:01:02,480
Let's go chase regrets again tomorrow

12
00:01:02,480 --> 00:01:03,300
Let it run

13
00:01:03,840 --> 00:01:07,660
Everybody can do, just a little

14
00:01:07,660 --> 00:01:10,800
Going a little overboard won't hurt,
you know

15
00:01:10,800 --> 00:01:15,000
Holding on to a restless curiosity

16
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:17,900
Had been reaching strong and high

17
00:01:28,880 --> 00:01:31,000
No way, Ryo-chan and Reiko...

18
00:01:37,260 --> 00:01:39,380
Is this the latest model of handcuffs?

19
00:01:39,380 --> 00:01:40,120
Yeah.

20
00:01:41,560 --> 00:01:45,080
It's lightweight and compact,
and stronger than steel.

21
00:01:45,660 --> 00:01:47,320
How exactly do you use them?

22
00:01:49,840 --> 00:01:53,280
If you just touch the inside
of the cuffs like this,

23
00:01:54,780 --> 00:01:57,240
they automatically lock.

24
00:01:58,660 --> 00:02:01,780
You unlock them with
this electronic lock key.

25
00:02:03,560 --> 00:02:05,700
See? Amazing. It's over in no time.

26
00:02:06,060 --> 00:02:08,440
With these,
catching criminals will be a breeze.

27
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:12,467
The shift-change guys finally got here.

28
00:02:12,517 --> 00:02:14,700
Tonight's night shift was rough

29
00:02:17,440 --> 00:02:19,580
You look really sleepy, Ryo-chan.

30
00:02:20,700 --> 00:02:22,840
Sleepy doesn't even begin to cover it.

31
00:02:22,840 --> 00:02:28,080
Five days ago we went to the
beach in the middle of the night,

32
00:02:28,560 --> 00:02:32,020
then every night we stayed up all night partying,
drinking and singing,

33
00:02:32,700 --> 00:02:36,160
and after that we easily pulled
off 70 hours without sleep,

34
00:02:36,920 --> 00:02:39,620
and then we rolled straight
into this night shift.

35
00:02:39,620 --> 00:02:42,740
We haven't slept for about 120 hours now.

36
00:02:42,740 --> 00:02:44,320
That's insane.

37
00:02:44,700 --> 00:02:48,019
Hey, when we get home today,
let's sleep for about 100 hours.

38
00:02:48,069 --> 00:02:49,080
My body feels so sluggish.

39
00:02:49,380 --> 00:02:51,820
Don't you think we need to
change our whole way of life?

40
00:02:52,760 --> 00:02:54,620
Yeah, that's an impossible request for me.

41
00:02:55,800 --> 00:02:56,740
What's that?

42
00:02:57,340 --> 00:02:59,760
This? It's a new model of handcuffs.

43
00:03:01,200 --> 00:03:04,140
See, it locks in just 0.2 seconds.

44
00:03:04,480 --> 00:03:06,118
That's interesting.

45
00:03:06,168 --> 00:03:09,040
So you just touch it? This is handy.

46
00:03:09,620 --> 00:03:10,900
You open it with this key.

47
00:03:39,480 --> 00:03:39,660
It is!

48
00:03:40,220 --> 00:03:43,700
Right here, you're under arrest!

49
00:03:45,380 --> 00:03:46,140
What?

50
00:03:46,180 --> 00:03:47,040
Whoa!

51
00:03:47,040 --> 00:03:50,660
Whoa! The key!

52
00:03:54,540 --> 00:03:56,740
Aaah! It swallowed it!

53
00:03:57,380 --> 00:03:57,820
Gah.

54
00:03:57,820 --> 00:03:58,960
Hey!

55
00:04:03,620 --> 00:04:05,860
Damn it, it got away!

56
00:04:07,400 --> 00:04:08,680
What are we supposed to do with this?!

57
00:04:09,480 --> 00:04:11,920
How should I know!
Hey, do something! Nakagawa!

58
00:04:12,600 --> 00:04:16,180
It's not mine. It's the one Terai-san
borrowed from the main station.

59
00:04:16,460 --> 00:04:20,400
Y-yeah. I'll check.
There should be a spare key.

60
00:04:23,380 --> 00:04:24,280
Yes, that's right.

61
00:04:25,840 --> 00:04:29,140
Ryo-chan,
you yelled so loudly that the dog ran off.

62
00:04:29,320 --> 00:04:31,180
You should have caught it gently.

63
00:04:31,520 --> 00:04:33,660
You're the one who caused the key to fall,
aren't you?

64
00:04:35,540 --> 00:04:36,840
I see. Yes.

65
00:04:36,840 --> 00:04:39,104
Yes. This is bad. The person in charge,

66
00:04:39,154 --> 00:04:42,180
apparently went on
vacation and left on a trip.

67
00:04:42,380 --> 00:04:45,300
What? What do you mean?
When is he coming back!

68
00:04:45,700 --> 00:04:47,280
Apparently, it's the day after tomorrow.

69
00:04:47,620 --> 00:04:49,454
What? That's 48 hours from now,

70
00:04:49,504 --> 00:04:51,860
and we're stuck with Reiko this whole time?!

71
00:04:52,480 --> 00:04:53,900
That's my line!

72
00:04:54,260 --> 00:04:57,280
Wait. Isn't today Saturday?

73
00:04:57,860 --> 00:04:58,600
It is, yes.

74
00:04:59,480 --> 00:05:00,780
Then this is no joke!

75
00:05:01,220 --> 00:05:02,560
It's Peace Day, isn't it!

76
00:05:03,420 --> 00:05:06,647
Damn, we don't have time for this.

77
00:05:06,697 --> 00:05:08,240
We have to do something about this.

78
00:05:09,340 --> 00:05:10,140
Yes, yes.

79
00:05:10,800 --> 00:05:13,640
Typical of the latest model.
Not a scratch on it.

80
00:05:14,360 --> 00:05:17,860
Ugh, I had a bad feeling from the moment
you two were playing with the handcuffs.

81
00:05:18,400 --> 00:05:22,340
Well, sorry, senpai, but I have something to do,
so I'm heading home first.

82
00:05:22,640 --> 00:05:25,200
What? Hey! Wait a minute, hey!

83
00:05:25,580 --> 00:05:28,100
Ryo-chan is working the shift with me.

84
00:05:28,640 --> 00:05:30,660
What did you say? Hey, hey, hey!

85
00:05:31,240 --> 00:05:34,520
Hold on! I haven't slept in 120 hours!

86
00:05:34,740 --> 00:05:36,940
You're really going to make
me work another eight hours?

87
00:05:37,100 --> 00:05:38,560
But there's nothing I can do about it,
is there?

88
00:05:39,560 --> 00:05:42,160
Today's my day off!
Why are you making me work?

89
00:05:42,820 --> 00:05:44,500
Fine, then do whatever you like.

90
00:05:44,500 --> 00:05:46,700
Of course, honestly.

91
00:05:47,720 --> 00:05:49,180
I'm going to sleep, so don't bother me.

92
00:05:52,300 --> 00:05:53,920
Amazing, in less than a second.

93
00:05:54,320 --> 00:05:57,760
You can sleep anywhere.
You're no different from an animal.

94
00:06:01,240 --> 00:06:08,480
Yes, this is Kameari Kōen-mae Hashutsujo, Ryotsu speaking.
Reiko-san, there's a call from Honjo for you.

95
00:06:09,980 --> 00:06:15,840
Ugh, you woke me up just as I'd finally dozed off!
Hey, come over here for a second. Yes, yes.

96
00:06:16,480 --> 00:06:18,680
Yes, I'm handing you over. Yes.

97
00:06:19,600 --> 00:06:23,880
We're going right now? Yes, understood.

98
00:06:27,100 --> 00:06:28,380
My head's burning up.

99
00:06:32,240 --> 00:06:33,480
What are you doing?

100
00:06:33,480 --> 00:06:35,300
We're going all the way to the station now.

101
00:06:35,820 --> 00:06:37,620
No way, I'm off duty today!

102
00:06:37,620 --> 00:06:39,040
I'm not going, no matter what!

103
00:06:41,640 --> 00:06:43,440
What do you think you're doing? Hey, you!

104
00:06:44,180 --> 00:06:45,640
They say it's urgent.

105
00:06:46,760 --> 00:06:47,480
Hey, hey!

106
00:06:47,480 --> 00:06:48,460
Let's go.

107
00:06:49,280 --> 00:06:49,980
Wait!

108
00:06:51,260 --> 00:06:52,780
Hey, look, Reiko.

109
00:06:53,880 --> 00:06:55,660
Why do I have to run?!

110
00:06:56,060 --> 00:06:59,360
It can't be helped. Riding a moped with two people is prohibited,
you know.

111
00:06:59,410 --> 00:07:01,420
Alright, I'm gonna step on it.
Hang in there!

112
00:07:01,620 --> 00:07:02,660
Stop it!

113
00:07:03,180 --> 00:07:04,440
Woohoo!

114
00:07:12,720 --> 00:07:15,000
Honestly, you're so pathetic,
over something like that.

115
00:07:15,440 --> 00:07:18,880
W-what? That was definitely a world record!

116
00:07:19,860 --> 00:07:21,340
Hold on to it properly.

117
00:07:22,760 --> 00:07:24,720
Because I'd be embarrassed
if someone spots us.

118
00:07:26,180 --> 00:07:28,200
Chief, what a bold couple.

119
00:07:28,880 --> 00:07:31,020
Truly, Beauty and the Beast.

120
00:07:32,780 --> 00:07:33,820
Hang on, stop a sec.

121
00:07:33,820 --> 00:07:34,980
What?

122
00:07:35,660 --> 00:07:38,340
This way! I suddenly need to pee.

123
00:07:38,340 --> 00:07:42,920
I can't go to a place like that with you.

124
00:07:42,920 --> 00:07:46,460
What do you mean you can't?
What are we going to do? I can't hold it!

125
00:07:46,900 --> 00:07:47,880
Well, this is a problem.

126
00:07:50,220 --> 00:07:52,380
What if I just go behind the backyard?

127
00:07:52,380 --> 00:07:55,060
So you want me to pee behind that?

128
00:07:56,780 --> 00:07:58,500
Even so,

129
00:08:02,040 --> 00:08:03,120
I can't hold it anymore.

130
00:08:03,120 --> 00:08:05,720
Hurry up already.

131
00:08:07,260 --> 00:08:10,340
Ugh, what did I ever do to deserve this?

132
00:08:10,340 --> 00:08:11,080
Reiko-san.

133
00:08:11,520 --> 00:08:13,920
What are you doing over there?

134
00:08:13,920 --> 00:08:16,240
I was just sunbathing.

135
00:08:17,880 --> 00:08:20,580
Isn't it new?
Let's play volleyball together.

136
00:08:20,580 --> 00:08:21,240
No!

137
00:08:21,320 --> 00:08:23,160
Whoa, not yet!

138
00:08:31,160 --> 00:08:32,060
I want to play!

139
00:08:36,880 --> 00:08:38,180
I told you it'd be faster!

140
00:08:38,340 --> 00:08:40,280
Look! Now they think I'm a pervert!

141
00:08:40,740 --> 00:08:41,640
Forget it.

142
00:08:43,460 --> 00:08:45,180
Well, excuse me.

143
00:08:45,180 --> 00:08:46,380
Yes, good work.

144
00:08:49,720 --> 00:08:50,960
Ryo-chan.

145
00:08:51,840 --> 00:08:54,480
Your errand's done, right?
Let's head back already.

146
00:08:54,480 --> 00:08:55,360
Listen.

147
00:08:56,420 --> 00:08:57,600
It's a toilet, you know.

148
00:08:58,720 --> 00:09:02,160
Well, if I went in with you,
I'd really become a pervert.

149
00:09:02,900 --> 00:09:05,940
Just do it outside like I would.
I'll close my eyes for you.

150
00:09:05,940 --> 00:09:08,140
There's no way I can do that.

151
00:09:08,600 --> 00:09:10,520
Then hold it until we
get back to the police box.

152
00:09:11,500 --> 00:09:13,740
There's only one way.

153
00:09:14,160 --> 00:09:15,040
How?

154
00:09:15,540 --> 00:09:18,160
Like this, and like this!

155
00:09:26,020 --> 00:09:28,280
I'm so sick of this life.

156
00:09:28,880 --> 00:09:31,100
Now I'm being treated like a pervert too.

157
00:09:36,820 --> 00:09:40,000
Ugh, I'm exhausted. My left hand hurts.

158
00:09:40,400 --> 00:09:41,980
I'm exhausted too, you know.

159
00:09:42,640 --> 00:09:45,260
You've been dragging me all
over the place on no sleep!

160
00:09:46,360 --> 00:09:47,140
I've worked up a sweat.

161
00:09:47,480 --> 00:09:49,100
Maybe I'll take a bath.

162
00:09:49,100 --> 00:09:50,300
A bath?

163
00:09:51,240 --> 00:09:52,360
No, it's fine.

164
00:09:52,780 --> 00:09:53,820
I promise I won't look.

165
00:09:55,180 --> 00:09:56,160
What's with that look?

166
00:09:56,160 --> 00:09:58,340
I'm not going to act like some molester.

167
00:09:59,180 --> 00:09:59,960
Ryo-chan.

168
00:10:02,400 --> 00:10:03,800
But just in case, you know.

169
00:10:09,700 --> 00:10:10,520
Damn it.

170
00:10:11,980 --> 00:10:15,380
You made me do it. Don't punch me
every time I change or use the toilet.

171
00:10:16,020 --> 00:10:20,260
You're building up a resistance
You're catching on faster now.

172
00:10:20,940 --> 00:10:22,720
Acting like I'm a cockroach or something.

173
00:10:23,480 --> 00:10:26,640
Are you going to take a bath alone, Reiko?
Let me in too.

174
00:10:27,040 --> 00:10:28,580
Wait, I'll be right out.

175
00:10:28,580 --> 00:10:29,820
No, right now.

176
00:10:31,860 --> 00:10:35,540
Don't get naked here!
If you're going in, just go in as you are.

177
00:10:36,160 --> 00:10:37,460
Don't be unreasonable.

178
00:10:41,520 --> 00:10:46,580
But how did you change clothes
with our hands still linked?

179
00:10:48,300 --> 00:10:49,500
It's just a little trick.

180
00:10:53,100 --> 00:10:55,220
I feel refreshed.

181
00:10:55,220 --> 00:10:57,900
I don't feel refreshed at all!

182
00:10:59,300 --> 00:11:01,720
That's what you get for going
into the bath with your clothes on.

183
00:11:01,720 --> 00:11:03,820
You're the one who said you were going in!

184
00:11:03,820 --> 00:11:07,000
Who could that be at this hour?

185
00:11:08,800 --> 00:11:10,340
Akimoto-san!

186
00:11:10,340 --> 00:11:12,140
It's the landlady.

187
00:11:12,560 --> 00:11:15,060
That woman is famous for her gossip.

188
00:11:15,580 --> 00:11:19,480
If she finds us like this,
who knows what rumors will spread.

189
00:11:20,040 --> 00:11:22,360
So what if they say something? Who cares.

190
00:11:22,360 --> 00:11:23,700
It's not that simple.

191
00:11:23,700 --> 00:11:25,280
Akimoto-san!

192
00:11:25,280 --> 00:11:28,280
Akimoto-san, Akimoto-san, hey!

193
00:11:28,800 --> 00:11:29,160
Yes?

194
00:11:30,420 --> 00:11:32,200
Sorry to keep you waiting.

195
00:11:32,200 --> 00:11:35,440
You were in the bath?
A package came for you.

196
00:11:36,220 --> 00:11:36,580
Thank you.

197
00:11:38,060 --> 00:11:41,820
By the way, you know the girl in room 8?

198
00:11:42,120 --> 00:11:44,920
I don't really like gossiping, but...

199
00:11:45,340 --> 00:11:50,180
Well, that girl brings a different
man back to her room every single day,

200
00:11:50,260 --> 00:11:52,340
she has no self-control whatsoever.

201
00:11:52,440 --> 00:11:54,220
Totally choberiba, juuga.

202
00:11:55,500 --> 00:11:57,760
Is that just how things are these days,
I wonder?

203
00:11:58,180 --> 00:12:01,000
Compared to that,
you're a rare breed these days.

204
00:12:01,480 --> 00:12:04,080
And you don't have any
shady men hanging around.

205
00:12:04,160 --> 00:12:06,140
Whoa, that's a bit harsh.

206
00:12:07,460 --> 00:12:07,560
Mm.

207
00:12:08,960 --> 00:12:09,840
Mm...

208
00:12:09,840 --> 00:12:11,240
Mm...

209
00:12:11,240 --> 00:12:11,600
Mm...

210
00:12:11,600 --> 00:12:12,180
Mm...

211
00:12:12,180 --> 00:12:12,780
Mm...

212
00:12:12,780 --> 00:12:12,820
Mm...

213
00:12:12,820 --> 00:12:12,900
Mm...

214
00:12:12,900 --> 00:12:13,340
Mm...

215
00:12:14,640 --> 00:12:16,220
Well, it's about time we went to sleep.

216
00:12:16,220 --> 00:12:19,380
Maybe I should change into a nightgown.

217
00:12:19,880 --> 00:12:23,060
He fell asleep without doing a thing.

218
00:12:23,660 --> 00:12:25,900
If you fall asleep there,
you'll catch a cold.

219
00:12:28,700 --> 00:12:30,060
No wonder, really.

220
00:12:30,580 --> 00:12:33,000
He's been awake for 135 hours, after all.

221
00:12:35,840 --> 00:12:36,240
Yes?

222
00:12:36,240 --> 00:12:37,520
It's Dad.

223
00:12:37,520 --> 00:12:39,060
Things just keep moving along, you know.

224
00:12:40,360 --> 00:12:42,400
What's wrong, Dad? Calling at this hour?

225
00:12:43,340 --> 00:12:44,800
I'm on my way over there right now.

226
00:12:47,300 --> 00:12:49,440
You're coming to Tokyo? What for?

227
00:12:50,800 --> 00:12:53,120
What? A marriage meeting? You never told me!

228
00:12:53,440 --> 00:12:54,420
That's strange.

229
00:12:54,940 --> 00:12:56,660
Anyway, one hour tomorrow.

230
00:12:56,660 --> 00:13:00,380
The other party is the young master of Tenkamaru Shoji,
one of our business partners.

231
00:13:01,000 --> 00:13:02,760
But suddenly being told
something like that...

232
00:13:03,220 --> 00:13:05,660
Besides, I'm not ready to get married yet.

233
00:13:05,660 --> 00:13:07,840
Is there someone you like?

234
00:13:08,400 --> 00:13:09,620
It's not like that.

235
00:13:09,620 --> 00:13:12,280
Chief, I didn't do it!

236
00:13:13,340 --> 00:13:15,320
Reiko! What was that man's voice just now?

237
00:13:15,560 --> 00:13:19,440
Ugh, Dad, it's the TV. Honestly, Ryo-chan.

238
00:13:20,340 --> 00:13:21,400
It was the TV.

239
00:13:21,880 --> 00:13:25,280
No, Reiko, stop it. I could've sworn I just heard
"Reiko."

240
00:13:25,560 --> 00:13:27,140
If it was the TV...

241
00:13:27,700 --> 00:13:30,440
O-okay. Then tomorrow. Good night.

242
00:13:31,400 --> 00:13:32,470
Ugh, what a problem.

243
00:13:32,520 --> 00:13:36,161
If I bring Ryo-chan along like this,
it'll be a huge commotion.

244
00:13:36,211 --> 00:13:38,900
Papa might even collapse from the shock.

245
00:13:50,220 --> 00:13:53,560
I think she'll be here soon, sorry.

246
00:13:53,560 --> 00:13:57,740
No, I don't mind a little delay at all.

247
00:13:57,740 --> 00:14:00,940
For Reiko-san, I'd wait for hours.

248
00:14:00,940 --> 00:14:03,100
Hey, Dad.

249
00:14:03,100 --> 00:14:04,240
Yes, indeed.

250
00:14:05,340 --> 00:14:06,700
Excuse me.

251
00:14:06,700 --> 00:14:08,820
Is that Reiko-san?

252
00:14:09,320 --> 00:14:11,640
Sorry to keep you waiting.

253
00:14:13,760 --> 00:14:16,920
I'm sorry, I got caught in traffic.

254
00:14:18,240 --> 00:14:19,720
Just a moment, let me set this down.

255
00:14:21,880 --> 00:14:22,580
There we go.

256
00:14:23,680 --> 00:14:24,520
Ohh.

257
00:14:25,300 --> 00:14:27,640
Isn't she cute?
I've grown really fond of her.

258
00:14:27,900 --> 00:14:29,840
She's always with me, wherever I go.

259
00:14:31,740 --> 00:14:34,280
Ryo-chan's been sleeping
nonstop since yesterday,

260
00:14:34,660 --> 00:14:37,920
so if he just keeps sleeping like this,
this can all end without a hitch.

261
00:14:38,440 --> 00:14:44,480
Reiko-san, you have a cute side after all.
I like that sort of thing.

262
00:14:44,480 --> 00:14:45,580
Well, thank you.

263
00:14:46,420 --> 00:14:51,440
As you may know, I'm a huge Tenkamaru fan.
I'm the young master of a Tenkamaru girl.

264
00:14:52,120 --> 00:14:56,080
I'm delighted to become acquainted
with Akimoto Trading like this.

265
00:14:56,740 --> 00:14:57,960
The pleasure is mine.

266
00:15:00,300 --> 00:15:02,080
So, what are your hobbies?

267
00:15:02,080 --> 00:15:07,100
Spending money. I have so much of it, it's such
a struggle to spend it all, such a struggle.

268
00:15:09,640 --> 00:15:11,600
What a splendid hobby.

269
00:15:12,320 --> 00:15:14,180
What are Reiko's hobbies?

270
00:15:14,180 --> 00:15:15,600
That's just my imagination.

271
00:15:15,600 --> 00:15:21,860
You poor thing, did it fall off?

272
00:15:22,480 --> 00:15:23,940
Even though I'm free now,

273
00:15:23,940 --> 00:15:26,540
I did say I wanted to be free.

274
00:15:26,540 --> 00:15:28,420
Is that so? I'm honored.

275
00:15:31,100 --> 00:15:32,640
Excuse me for a moment.

276
00:15:35,600 --> 00:15:36,880
That's the situation.

277
00:15:38,380 --> 00:15:41,920
So that's why I'm stuck
in this tanuki costume?

278
00:15:42,320 --> 00:15:43,740
Hey, Ryo-chan, please.

279
00:15:44,360 --> 00:15:47,180
Just keep this up so nobody
finds out until the omiai is over.

280
00:15:47,960 --> 00:15:51,800
You actually like a
dumb-faced guy like that?

281
00:15:52,960 --> 00:15:53,880
No, not at all.

282
00:15:54,460 --> 00:15:56,880
He's an important client of Daddy's.

283
00:15:57,280 --> 00:16:01,100
If it goes well, I'll buy you that
radio-controlled helicopter you wanted.

284
00:16:01,100 --> 00:16:02,600
Radio-controlled what?

285
00:16:03,220 --> 00:16:04,260
Alright, I'm in.

286
00:16:04,640 --> 00:16:06,160
Leave it all to me.

287
00:16:07,920 --> 00:16:10,840
But I hear you're into real estate,
miss, is that right?

288
00:16:13,320 --> 00:16:15,400
Even with the remote-control
helicopter on the line,

289
00:16:15,400 --> 00:16:17,660
staying this still is pretty tough,
you know.

290
00:16:17,660 --> 00:16:22,580
That looks tasty, and there's sake too.

291
00:16:23,640 --> 00:16:26,000
Come to think of it,
I haven't eaten anything since last night.

292
00:16:27,340 --> 00:16:28,400
Okay, just watch.

293
00:16:28,400 --> 00:16:32,160
After all, our Tenkamaru family

294
00:16:32,580 --> 00:16:36,160
first head was that Himiko's mother's...

295
00:16:38,440 --> 00:16:39,940
Something like this is a piece of cake.

296
00:16:41,200 --> 00:16:42,360
Reiko-san.

297
00:16:43,080 --> 00:16:43,480
Yes.

298
00:16:45,140 --> 00:16:48,320
If we were to get married,
where would you prefer to live?

299
00:16:48,320 --> 00:16:51,140
Well, Ashiya or Denenchofu, I suppose.

300
00:16:51,680 --> 00:16:52,920
Anywhere, really.

301
00:16:53,660 --> 00:16:57,140
I see. I'm fine anywhere
except the Shitamachi.

302
00:16:57,140 --> 00:16:57,880
What?

303
00:16:58,560 --> 00:17:01,240
No, hang on, hang on...
a radio-controlled helicopter isn't enough!

304
00:17:01,240 --> 00:17:04,920
Look, the Shitamachi is kind of old-fashioned and rough,
isn't it?

305
00:17:04,920 --> 00:17:06,880
Damn, that stung.

306
00:17:07,920 --> 00:17:10,643
I don't like this town.

307
00:17:10,693 --> 00:17:13,040
It's so crude, I really can't stand it.

308
00:17:13,520 --> 00:17:15,400
Hey, Reiko-san, what do you think?

309
00:17:17,440 --> 00:17:18,480
Delicious.

310
00:17:28,460 --> 00:17:30,178
Water, water, water,

311
00:17:30,228 --> 00:17:32,880
Water, water, please.

312
00:17:41,920 --> 00:17:43,840
- It's important!
- I'll be right back!

313
00:17:49,060 --> 00:17:50,240
Excuse me!

314
00:17:51,660 --> 00:17:54,400
What do you think? Shall we go somewhere and talk,
just the two of us?

315
00:17:54,760 --> 00:17:57,639
That's a good idea.
Let the young ones be with each other.

316
00:17:57,689 --> 00:17:59,240
Right, Tenkamaru-san?

317
00:17:59,580 --> 00:18:00,480
Indeed.

318
00:18:05,940 --> 00:18:07,720
- Reiko-san.
- Yes?

319
00:18:07,980 --> 00:18:09,860
We're finally alone, aren't we?

320
00:18:10,120 --> 00:18:11,020
Y-yes.

321
00:18:11,920 --> 00:18:15,100
Reiko-san,
from the moment I first laid eyes on you...

322
00:18:15,100 --> 00:18:16,240
Well...

323
00:18:16,820 --> 00:18:18,160
Reiko-san...

324
00:18:19,480 --> 00:18:22,040
There's a Dragon King
show going on over there!

325
00:18:22,840 --> 00:18:24,540
What? Dragon King?

326
00:18:31,060 --> 00:18:33,676
I must be imagining things,

327
00:18:33,726 --> 00:18:39,060
but I thought I saw a tanuki running...

328
00:18:39,060 --> 00:18:40,820
Dragon King!

329
00:18:43,260 --> 00:18:44,560
Dragon King!

330
00:18:55,180 --> 00:18:58,220
Well, every now and then,
this sort of thing is nice, isn't it?

331
00:18:58,220 --> 00:18:58,900
Yes.

332
00:19:00,080 --> 00:19:01,960
Chance, subtle as ever

333
00:19:02,880 --> 00:19:04,560
Go on, Dragon King!

334
00:19:04,940 --> 00:19:06,960
And then, the Dragon King...

335
00:19:06,960 --> 00:19:09,400
Oh my, what's the matter?

336
00:19:09,400 --> 00:19:09,520
What's wrong?

337
00:19:10,980 --> 00:19:14,000
Ahaha, no, it's nothing...

338
00:19:14,000 --> 00:19:15,740
That's strange...

339
00:19:16,340 --> 00:19:18,200
Calm down, calm down...

340
00:19:18,900 --> 00:19:20,520
Dragon Champ!

341
00:19:28,300 --> 00:19:29,600
Pretty good, right?

342
00:19:30,420 --> 00:19:31,160
Whoa!

343
00:19:33,160 --> 00:19:34,200
Oh no, I've done it! I've done it!

344
00:19:34,200 --> 00:19:36,760
This makes me the tanuki
from Kachi-Kachi Mountain!

345
00:19:37,640 --> 00:19:39,040
Ryo-chan, go on!

346
00:19:39,480 --> 00:19:40,220
Help me!

347
00:19:40,700 --> 00:19:45,900
It's really shallow...

348
00:19:48,860 --> 00:19:52,680
But at least that's good.
Half your face is safe.

349
00:19:52,960 --> 00:19:53,680
Damn it.

350
00:19:54,220 --> 00:19:56,440
But this is a problem.
If it stays like this...

351
00:19:56,440 --> 00:19:58,480
Reiko-san! Reiko-san!

352
00:19:58,780 --> 00:20:00,600
What should we do? We'll be found!

353
00:20:00,760 --> 00:20:02,240
What do I do, Tatteomayon.

354
00:20:03,440 --> 00:20:05,340
Reiko-san, Reiko-san's place...

355
00:20:10,840 --> 00:20:12,400
Why are you being so useless?

356
00:20:12,920 --> 00:20:14,720
So this is where you were.

357
00:20:14,720 --> 00:20:17,000
It's your turn, come on, hurry up!

358
00:20:17,000 --> 00:20:17,800
Hey, what's going on?

359
00:20:17,800 --> 00:20:19,500
Come on, go on, that one!

360
00:20:24,300 --> 00:20:26,140
Clumsy Devil General.

361
00:20:27,360 --> 00:20:29,640
But who's this girl?

362
00:20:30,380 --> 00:20:32,920
Dragon King, I'm a huge fan of his.

363
00:20:36,440 --> 00:20:38,120
Look! Pink Devil, sliced in half!

364
00:20:49,080 --> 00:20:51,760
General Babil just took down Pink Devil!

365
00:20:53,180 --> 00:20:54,380
What are you doing, you idiot!

366
00:20:54,880 --> 00:20:56,000
Reiko, you do it too!

367
00:20:57,100 --> 00:20:59,280
What?! He's really going at it for real!

368
00:20:59,940 --> 00:21:02,080
If that's how they want to play,
let's give it right back to them!

369
00:21:02,740 --> 00:21:03,240
Yeah!

370
00:21:05,480 --> 00:21:06,700
Well, there's no choice now.

371
00:21:20,820 --> 00:21:23,460
Go on, everyone, take on those two!

372
00:21:24,140 --> 00:21:25,020
Come on, go!

373
00:21:33,240 --> 00:21:34,380
Reiko-san!

374
00:21:34,540 --> 00:21:36,360
Honestly, where did she go?

375
00:21:36,620 --> 00:21:37,320
Taah!

376
00:21:38,000 --> 00:21:38,560
Rei!

377
00:21:40,400 --> 00:21:40,700
Hah!

378
00:21:43,460 --> 00:21:45,560
R-Reiko-san, you're so wonderful.

379
00:21:45,700 --> 00:21:46,980
Reiko-san!

380
00:21:47,140 --> 00:21:48,240
Reiko-san!

381
00:21:48,240 --> 00:21:48,940
Reiko-san!

382
00:21:49,200 --> 00:21:50,260
What are you doing?

383
00:21:50,260 --> 00:21:50,980
Yo!

384
00:21:55,660 --> 00:21:56,303
Hey, wait,

385
00:21:56,353 --> 00:21:59,680
That doesn't seem fitting for Tenkamaru's harassment,
does it?

386
00:22:00,320 --> 00:22:01,240
Haa...

387
00:22:02,040 --> 00:22:02,740
Eeh!?

388
00:22:04,980 --> 00:22:07,120
After that, everything went to pieces.

389
00:22:07,540 --> 00:22:09,740
But at least the handcuffs finally came off,
and I was relieved.

390
00:22:09,740 --> 00:22:12,940
Honestly,
these handcuffs nearly got me killed.

391
00:22:13,840 --> 00:22:16,660
Still, maybe we were lucky.

392
00:22:16,660 --> 00:22:19,880
The officer in charge is apparently
suspended for a month starting today.

393
00:22:20,300 --> 00:22:22,520
A month? That was close.

394
00:22:23,060 --> 00:22:25,020
By the way, how did Reiko's omiai go?

395
00:22:25,680 --> 00:22:27,980
I bet they turned you down, right?

396
00:22:28,840 --> 00:22:29,240
This one.

397
00:22:31,200 --> 00:22:31,520
This one.

398
00:22:32,160 --> 00:22:33,920
Yes, the radio-controlled
helicopter we promised.

399
00:22:33,920 --> 00:22:35,100
Yes!

400
00:22:35,100 --> 00:22:37,640
So, did the omiai go well?

401
00:22:39,020 --> 00:22:41,040
I never had any intention
of getting married anyway.

402
00:22:41,720 --> 00:22:43,680
I went through with the
omiai to save Daddy's face.

403
00:22:44,100 --> 00:22:47,400
I was agonizing over how
to turn down that awful man.

404
00:22:47,780 --> 00:22:48,980
It's all thanks to Ryo-chan.

405
00:22:48,980 --> 00:22:51,520
I thought as much too.

406
00:22:53,200 --> 00:22:55,500
These handcuffs really come in handy,
don't they?

407
00:22:56,860 --> 00:22:57,520
Ryotsu

408
00:22:58,300 --> 00:22:58,940
Chief

409
00:22:59,540 --> 00:23:00,680
Good morning.

410
00:23:00,680 --> 00:23:04,500
You're going to fool around with that during work again,
aren't you?

411
00:23:04,980 --> 00:23:05,960
N-no, nothing like that!

412
00:23:05,960 --> 00:23:08,400
I've always been devoted
solely to my work, sir!

413
00:23:08,400 --> 00:23:12,340
Look, this isn't a toy.
It's the latest model of handcuffs.

414
00:23:12,340 --> 00:23:15,860
See? Isn't it amazing?

415
00:23:16,420 --> 00:23:16,840
I see.

416
00:23:17,400 --> 00:23:19,020
Fine, I get it, just take them off.

417
00:23:19,020 --> 00:23:20,900
Here, this key's -

418
00:23:20,900 --> 00:23:22,220
Oh my.

419
00:23:22,740 --> 00:23:23,160
Whoa.

420
00:23:23,160 --> 00:23:23,640
Whoa!

421
00:23:32,500 --> 00:23:34,340
Hurry up and take them off!

422
00:23:35,380 --> 00:23:36,260
Chief.

423
00:23:36,260 --> 00:23:37,000
What's wrong?

424
00:23:37,000 --> 00:23:39,320
They won't come off for a month.

425
00:23:42,040 --> 00:23:45,520
What exactly do you plan to do?

426
00:23:45,920 --> 00:23:47,840
Stuck with the Chief for a month? I'll die!

427
00:23:47,840 --> 00:23:50,760
You really never learn, do you?

428
00:24:03,820 --> 00:24:06,940
Thank you for watching.

429
00:24:29,160 --> 00:24:37,760
Even if you stop the clock,
time keeps passing.

430
00:24:39,380 --> 00:24:48,020
Don't frown, laugh it off and live on.

431
00:24:49,920 --> 00:24:57,940
Even if it's raining today,

432
00:24:57,940 --> 00:25:03,460
tomorrow will be sunny.

433
00:25:03,460 --> 00:25:08,620
Bye-bye, let's wave goodbye.

434
00:25:08,620 --> 00:25:13,860
Say goodbye to the unpleasant things.

435
00:25:13,860 --> 00:25:21,480
Oh yeah, let's try living as we like.

436
00:25:21,480 --> 00:25:23,940
Good things will come.

437
00:25:23,940 --> 00:25:30,300
The sun is calling you
from outside the door.

438
00:25:43,860 --> 00:25:43,920
Thank you for watching.

